      "id": "claim_3237fd4bb5b440378065fcf78980d475",
      "statement": "Cite-Right 0.4.0 ships abi3 wheels built with `abi3-py311`, plus linux/aarch64 wheels and an sdist, so a single wheel per platform covers CPython 3.11+ and arm64 Docker installs do not need a source build.",
