      "statement": "Setting an embedder no longer disables Rust prepare. The Rust prepare branch in `PreparedCitationCorpus.from_sources` accepts an `embedder` argument and builds the embedding index on the Rust-prepared candidates, so the 0.3.x skip of Rust prepare on the embedder path is gone.",
      "evidence": [
