      "statement": "Embedding-only entries on `retrieval_support` still respect the configured `min_embedding_similarity` (default 0.3) enforced in `_build_retrieval_support`; lexical scores are filled only for inverted-index seeds, and embedding-only extras keep `lexical_score == 0.0`.",
